// Customer-side reads of live status notices. Not a "use server" module (these are
// called from server components, never exposed as endpoints). Public by design: a
// status notice is customer-facing information, and the deploy wizard also serves
// signed-out visitors (the guest configurator), so nothing here needs a user.

